  "instructions": [
    "Heat butter in a large pot over medium heat until melted.",
    "Add onion, garlic, carrot, and celery, sautéing until the vegetables soften, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the diced potatoes and vegetable broth, bringing the mixture to a gentle boil.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes until the potatoes are tender.",
    "Whisk soy milk, vanilla extract, salt, and pepper in a small bowl, then stir into the stew.",
    "Continue to simmer, uncovered, for an additional 10 minutes to allow the custard to thicken.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed, then remove from heat.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley before serving."
  ],
